    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d52">

                <pb facs="0114" n="98" xml:id="pg98"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">501.BB/10–649: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the United States Representative at the United Nations</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Austin</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-10-06T17:00:00-05:00">October 6, 1949—5
                            p. m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    Gadel 33. Dept approves draft resolution
                    contained urtel Oct 6<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d52-f1"/> as basis for consultations with other Dels with exception
                    of para relating to repudiation of treaties which Dept proposes be deleted. Dept
                    desires that resolution have as broad and representative sponsorship as possible
                    so that it can be adopted by overwhelming vote.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Webb</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
